  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">I Wanna Dance</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: easy box circulates from a half <u>hey</u> to a wave</h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/75\">Erik Hoffman</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>6</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">pass through ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">next neighbors swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles chain</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a half hey - rights in center, lefts on ends - and <u>partners</u> take left hands</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - ladles face in, gentlespoons face out</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - ladles cross while gentlespoons loop left - and <u>neighbors</u> take left hands</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - gentlespoons face in, ladles face out</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - gentlespoons cross while ladles loop left</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
